<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Paging Net, Arch Comms.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Paging Net, Arch Comms.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Securities said it downgraded shares in paging companies Paging Network Inc and Arch Communications Group Inc to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Paging Network was off 1/16 to 9-1/16 and Arch was up 1/8 at 8-1/4.</p>
</text>
